{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"左上方第一块大字号文字，尤其是薄荷绿色高亮的“舒舒服服地待在这份亲近里”和“沉默也很舒服”。位置靠上、字号最大、颜色突出，第一眼会先落在这里。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"他正和某个人处于亲近相处的状态，暂时只想待在这份亲近里。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"舒服、安静、放松。\",\n  \"missed\": \"心却慢慢漂远的微妙转折；他其实很想表达喜欢，也想确认对方是否有同样的感受，却最终没有开口。这些信息需要继续读完整句子和下方另一块大字才能获得。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"上方大字单块较长，包含不考虑未来、享受亲近、沉默舒服、内心漂远等多个层次，不能只凭高亮词完整理解。\",\n    \"上方和下方两块大字号文字都很醒目，争夺主视线。\",\n    \"核心心理状态分散在上下两块文字中，需要拼接才能理解舒适的表面状态与内心犹豫、漂远之间的关系。\",\n    \"中间的小字连续堆叠，补充了水波、声音、思绪等意象，但快速扫视时不容易提取。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "27af273f-4898-43a5-bbfc-5802c1262ed5", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T011140757864Z", "elapsed_seconds": 47.859, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T01:12:28.609518+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "562ed70605b37e6e3e455042c996a00d38d2730020c5e5c4352d76b36b706b34", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessio